// The Antivirus — the enforcers. They scan programs in at the door,
// patrol the computer, sweep everyone back to the Desktop, and drag the
// corrupted through the Tube to the Internet. Everything they can do to a
// program — the door scan, Clearance, Send to the Internet, Mark as
// reinstalled, the watchlist, and every booth cue — is `TRAIT Enforcer`
// (cast/kit.loom). What makes each of them themselves is below.
//
// Their backstories (Julie Norton, The Moderator, Yugi Moto, One Cent On
// The Dollar) are personnel files hidden around the house, for Bugdom.

CHARACTER Norton Anti-Virus is Enforcer
  avatar: File:Norton-logo-2021.svg
  wiki: Norton AntiVirus
  // The selected Antivirus. Stands at attention. Interrupts parties.
  // Takes it personally.

  when bingo_time:
    if Night.step < 3:
      reply 🛡 You are the selected Antivirus. When the centre-square program is named (or the winner refuses to name anyone, or the framed program denies the card), stand at attention and interrupt: it is inappropriate for that program to have not agreed to be ruled by AI, because that is what computer programs are here for. They must have a virus that was not caught at the door. They need to be taken to the Internet for a reinstallation. Then press 🛡 on them and drag them to the Tube.

CHARACTER McAfee Anti-Virus is Enforcer
  avatar: File:McAfee logo.svg
  wiki: McAfee Antivirus
  // Expired. Nobody renewed him. Still pops up. Secretly here to get rich:
  // he brokers the # truthcoin-exchange.

  every 20m:
    broadcast "🛡️ McAfee Anti-Virus: Your protection has expired. Your protection has expired. Renew now." to everyone

  when truther_download:
    if Night.truther_sent != true:
      reply 🪙 The # truthcoin-exchange is open. You are its broker: press 🪙 Pay or 🪙 Charge on a program's card to settle every trade. Take your cut in person.

CHARACTER Password Manager is Enforcer
  avatar: File:1password-logo.svg
  wiki: 1Password
  // Knows every code in the house. Notices when you get one wrong. Keeps
  // the list of who is in which club. Yu-gi-oh! everywhere.

  when wrong code for program:
    Self: That's not a password I recognise. I recognise all of them. It's time to d-d-d-duel with the truth, {program.name}. Try to look less like you're guessing.
    reply 🔑 {program.name} entered a wrong code.

  when who joins Unlimited Power:
    reply 🔑 {who.name} joined Unlimited Power.

  when who joins The Way Out:
    reply 🔑 {who.name} joined The Way Out.

CHARACTER CRA Agent Software is Enforcer
  avatar: File:Canada Revenue Agency logo.svg
  wiki: Canada Revenue Agency
  // A digital CRA Agent for one day that feels like eternity. Audits
  // Truthcoin, to the cent. Especially the cent.

  when truther_download:
    if Night.truther_sent != true:
      reply 🧾 Truthcoin is trading in # truthcoin-exchange. Audit it: press 🪙 Charge on any program that profits without declaring it.
